A div closes only on a run of its own width

```
:::
:::e
::::
q
:::
after
.
<div>
  <p>:::e</p>
  <div>
    <p>q</p>
    <div>
      <p>after</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
```

```
- :::
  :::e
  ::::
  :::
l
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div>
      <p>:::e</p>
      <div>
        <div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </li>
</ul>
<p>l</p>
```

